Transactions, point reads or writes.

84
00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:33.182
Order lines, events, clickstream for analytics.

85
00:06:33.462 --> 00:06:34.507
Store or path:

86
00:06:34.787 --> 00:06:35.726
Lakehouse:

87
00:06:36.006 --> 00:06:39.697
Parquet or Iceberg on object storage, partitioned by date.

88
00:06:39.977 --> 00:06:40.659
Why:

89
00:06:40.939 --> 00:06:43.841
Columnar scans, cheap storage, many engines.

90
00:06:45.191 --> 00:06:47.516
BI dashboards, finance reports.

91
00:06:47.796 --> 00:06:48.841
Store or path:

92
00:06:49.121 --> 00:06:55.713
Warehouse or lakehouse SQL engine (Trino, BigQuery, Snowflake, DuckDB for small data).

93
00:06:55.993 --> 00:06:56.676
Why:

94
00:06:56.956 --> 00:06:58.599
Never on OLTP primaries.

95
00:06:58.879 --> 00:07:02.313
Daily settlement, invoices, loyalty reconciliation.

96
00:07:02.593 --> 00:07:03.639
