97
00:07:03.919 --> 00:07:06.649
Batch (Spring Batch), restartable, idempotent.

98
00:07:06.929 --> 00:07:07.612
Why:

99
00:07:07.892 --> 00:07:09.449
Correct, auditable, cheap.

100
00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:11.991
Demand board, surge, fraud signals.

101
00:07:12.271 --> 00:07:13.316
