252
00:17:05.398 --> 00:17:15.830
Prices and stock on public pages: short TTL + surrogate-key purge (tag every response with sku-7, purge the tag on change) + stale-if-error.

253
00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:20.227
Personalised data (cart, addresses): not cached at the CDN.

254
00:17:20.507 --> 00:17:23.814
Stale-if-error turns the CDN into a resilience layer.

255
00:17:24.094 --> 00:17:31.731
L2: origin down for 5 s, and the strict TTL returned 50 errors while stale-if-error served 50 of 50.

