321
00:19:58.694 --> 00:20:08.742
754 MB of CSV, 1.4 GB in PostgreSQL with indexes, and 58 MB as zstd Parquet.

322
00:20:09.022 --> 00:20:13.737
Vectorised execution processes batches of values per operator call.

323
00:20:14.017 --> 00:20:21.910
Partition pruning skips files whose partition value doesn't match, and min or max statistics skip row groups within files.

324
00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:26.076
