325
00:20:26.356 --> 00:20:34.335
Computing the local date once during the transform (instead of time-zone math on every row, every query) was worth 7x.

326
00:20:35.685 --> 00:20:37.114
Warehouse, lake, lakehouse.

327
00:20:37.394 --> 00:20:38.738
Here is a quick table:

328
00:20:39.018 --> 00:20:41.514
