342
00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:12.719
Schema-on-write with evolution; ACID commits; time travel.

343
00:21:12.999 --> 00:21:13.831
Engines.

344
00:21:14.111 --> 00:21:15.221
Data warehouse:

345
00:21:15.501 --> 00:21:16.759
The warehouse's own.

346
00:21:17.039 --> 00:21:17.978
Data lake:

347
00:21:18.258 --> 00:21:19.773
Anything that reads files.

348
00:21:20.053 --> 00:21:20.991
Lakehouse:

349
00:21:21.271 --> 00:21:26.946
Many engines (Spark, Trino, Flink, DuckDB, Snowflake, BigQuery) on the same tables.

350
00:21:27.226 --> 00:21:28.527
Updates or deletes.

351
00:21:28.807 --> 00:21:29.917
Data warehouse:

352
00:21:30.197 --> 00:21:30.922
Yes.

353
00:21:31.202 --> 00:21:32.141
