Replaced by unified engines + batch truth.

652
00:39:06.563 --> 00:39:08.057
Processing-time streaming.

653
00:39:08.337 --> 00:39:09.190
Pros:

654
00:39:09.470 --> 00:39:10.238
Simple.

655
00:39:10.518 --> 00:39:11.329
Cons:

656
00:39:11.609 --> 00:39:13.635
Wrong under late data (L4:

657
00:39:13.915 --> 00:39:15.345
30 % exact).

