660
00:39:18.983 --> 00:39:19.665
8.

661
00:39:19.945 --> 00:39:21.097
Failure modes.

662
00:39:21.377 --> 00:39:26.967
CDC lag, then the silver freshness SLO alerts, and dashboards show data as of.

663
00:39:27.247 --> 00:39:32.495
Purge API failure, then retry with backoff, and the TTL bounds staleness.

664
00:39:32.775 --> 00:39:37.959
Presigned URL leak, then short expiry, one key, and authorisation at signing.

665
00:39:38.239 --> 00:39:45.428
Stream job restart, then restored from the checkpoint; the lateness bound covers the downtime or a reprocess runs.

666
00:39:45.708 --> 00:39:46.412
10.

667
00:39:46.692 --> 00:39:47.780
Observability.

668
00:39:49.130 --> 00:39:53.375
CDN: hit ratio by path, origin egress, purge latency.

669
00:39:53.655 --> 00:39:54.871
Object storage:

670
00:39:55.151 --> 00:39:59.055
4xx or 5xx rates, incomplete multipart bytes.

671
00:39:59.335 --> 00:40:03.837
Lake: freshness per table, file counts and small-file compaction backlog.

672
00:40:04.117 --> 00:40:06.506
Batch: duration, rows, restarts.

673
00:40:06.786 --> 00:40:12.333
