674
00:40:13.683 --> 00:40:14.536
14.

675
00:40:14.816 --> 00:40:19.104
Decision (ADR-088 to 092 summary).

676
00:40:19.384 --> 00:40:22.755
Blobs in object storage behind presigned URLs.

