712
00:43:08.677 --> 00:43:27.877
Product images and invoices in object storage, using the plain S3 REST API with AWS Signature V4 written out by hand: bucket + PUT or GET or HEAD, range reads, prefix listing, presigned upload or download URLs (direct from the app, bypassing our servers).

713
00:43:30.727 --> 00:43:31.644
On screen:

714
00:43:31.924 --> 00:43:32.543
