716
00:43:38.692 --> 00:43:46.372
PUT products or sku-1001 or main.jpg (480,000 B), then 200, ETag.

717
00:43:46.652 --> 00:43:54.033
929df4cadcea3fdff1ba15cacfdb132b.

718
00:43:54.313 --> 00:44:00.436
HEAD, then 200, Content-Length 480000, Content-Type image or jpeg.

719
00:44:00.716 --> 00:44:10.039
GET Range bytes=0 to 1023, then 206, 1,024 bytes (thumbnail header or resumable download).

720
00:44:10.319 --> 00:44:15.289
LIST prefix products or sku-1002/, then 200, 3 keys.

721
00:44:15.569 --> 00:44:16.252
