722
00:44:16.532 --> 00:44:33.556
Presigned URLs: the app uploads straight to storage; our servers only sign. presigned PUT, valid 5 min, then 200. presigned GET, then 200. same URL, key changed to rider-78, then 403 (signature covers the path).

723
00:44:33.836 --> 00:44:42.689
URL signed 10 min ago, valid 60 s, then 403 (expired). unsigned GET of a private object, then 403.

