1145
01:19:03.548 --> 01:19:09.436
Design the image and media pipeline for 400K SKUs from 2,000 sellers.

1146
01:19:10.786 --> 01:19:12.130
Question 17.

1147
01:19:12.410 --> 01:19:14.863
The finance team wants real-time GMV.

1148
01:19:15.143 --> 01:19:16.359
How do you respond?

1149
01:19:16.639 --> 01:19:18.005
Thirty-second answer:

1150
01:19:18.285 --> 01:19:20.375
Ask what decision needs real time.

1151
01:19:20.655 --> 01:19:28.655
Operations (staffing, surge) benefit from minute-level GMV, which is a streaming, event-time metric labelled provisional.

1152
01:19:28.935 --> 01:19:35.805
Finance reporting needs exact, auditable, reconciled numbers, which is T+1 batch from the lakehouse.

1153
01:19:36.085 --> 01:19:44.149
Provide both, clearly labelled, with a daily reconciliation between them, rather than making finance depend on a streaming pipeline.

1154
01:19:45.499 --> 01:19:46.672
